<title>AUSTRALIA: St George issues A$300 mln bond - sources.</title>
<headline>St George issues A$300 mln bond - sources.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>St George Bank has issued a A$300 million bond issue through BZW, market sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The sources said the bonds mature July 15, 1999 and carry a coupon of 6.1 percent and are expected to be priced at some 36 basis points over the July 1999 government bond.</p>
<p>There was no immediate confirmation from either St George Bank or BZW.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
